==Dutch==

===Etymology===
From a derivative of {{etyl|la|nl}} {{term|Saturnus|lang=nl}} + Dutch {{term|dag|lang=nl}}, a calque of Latin {{term|dies Saturni|lang=la}}. Compare West Frisian {{term|saterdei|lang=fy}}, English {{term|Saturday|lang=en}}.

===Pronunciation===
* {{IPA|/ˈzaːtərˌdɑx/|lang=nl}}
*{{audio|Nl-zaterdag.ogg|audio}}

===Noun===
{{nl-noun|m|zaterdagen|zaterdagje}}

# [[Saturday]]

